  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EkjfUcD.png\" alt=\"Mace Enchant Indicator Title\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Mace Enchant Indicator 是一款简单的材质包，它会根据战锤附魔的颜色在原版 Minecraft 中改变战锤的颜色，无需任何模组即可使用。</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmace-enchant-indicator\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tkYBV4Y.png\" alt=\"Modrinth Icon\" width=\"50\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mace-enchant-indicator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DKccFbz.png\" alt=\"CurseForge Icon\" width=\"50\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fmace-enchant-indicator-breach-and-density%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dJ2b3lN.png\" alt=\"PMC Icon\" width=\"50\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CPBFV3dytW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PrecisionZero/PrecisionStudios/refs/heads/main/Modrinth Elements/DiscordIcon.png\" alt=\"Discord Icon\" width=\"50\"> </a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G3UF7lv.png\" alt=\"Mace Enchant Indicator Featured Image\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">功能特点</h2>\n<ul style=\"text-align:left\">\n<li>带有<strong>密度</strong>附魔的战锤显示为红色</li>\n<li>带有<strong>破甲</strong>附魔的战锤显示为蓝色</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">为什么选择 Mace Enchant Indicator？</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">人类对颜色的感知速度快于形状。本材质包利用这一特性，使附魔效果一目了然，让你无需手动检查即可分辨手中持有的战锤类型。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">与 Minecraft 26.3 快照版的兼容性</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">⚠️ 你只能通过 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmace-enchant-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></strong> 下载适用于 Minecraft 快照版 26.3+ 的 Mace Enchant Indicator 版本。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">概览</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">截图</h3>\n<table style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>破甲 (Breach)</th>\n<th>密度 (Density)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4bc614e11d32eb3ef7324b9a7ff373cd94fbfea9.png\" alt=\"Breach Screenshot\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cac68497677b3314c45aac749c061c5c42162274.png\" alt=\"Density (Glint)\" width=\"400\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f4bc614e11d32eb3ef7324b9a7ff373cd94fbfea9.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fcac68497677b3314c45aac749c061c5c42162274.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\">风爆 (Wind Burst) 附加效果</h4>\n<table style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>破甲 + 风爆</th>\n<th>密度 + 风爆</th>\n<th>普通 + 风爆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/71aad69df338db6e8847ae8977aab819d7a2f953.png\" alt=\"Breach + Windburst Screenshot\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/399b4d828feefa30833ddff1b51afbb82bd60d9d.png\" alt=\"Density + Windburst Screenshot\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c1e2c535dcc6cc01a8538258ed44a3d09a92dd85.png\" alt=\"Regular + Windburst Screenshot\" width=\"400\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f71aad69df338db6e8847ae8977aab819d7a2f953.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f399b4d828feefa30833ddff1b51afbb82bd60d9d.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fc1e2c535dcc6cc01a8538258ed44a3d09a92dd85.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">附魔说明</h3>\n<table style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>破甲 (Breach)</th>\n<th>密度 (Density)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9hfeyIB.png\" alt=\"Breach Card\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y4PHaqe.png\" alt=\"Density (Glint)\" width=\"400\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f6403a3a41a3de4df8f3018c602f3e05a1b858f03.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252f8803428a05e7e4c6f33d09967d8024ee229962ca.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\">风爆 (Wind Burst) 附加效果</h4>\n<table style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>破甲 + 风爆</th>\n<th>密度 + 风爆</th>\n<th>普通 + 风爆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b0a651b69da3237281b939f278f201584f3d8b05.png\" alt=\"Breach + Windburst Card\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb384d032871ab974c63c058f043c81ba72c0c33.png\" alt=\"Density + Windburst Card\" width=\"400\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e2298e9e4f821fcfa0bef86b767c1a20d3583462.png\" alt=\"Regular + Windburst Card\" width=\"400\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fb0a651b69da3237281b939f278f201584f3d8b05.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fcb384d032871ab974c63c058f043c81ba72c0c33.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fe2298e9e4f821fcfa0bef86b767c1a20d3583462.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看原图</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">技术信息</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">要求</h3>\n<table style=\"margin-left:0px;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材质包版本</th>\n<th>Minecraft 版本</th>\n<th>Forge</th>\n<th>Fabric</th>\n<th>原版 (Vanilla)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.x</td>\n<td>1.21-Snapshot 26.2+</td>\n<td>✔ 支持</td>\n<td>✔ 支持</td>\n<td>✔ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.0</td>\n<td>1.21-Snapshot 26.2+</td>\n<td>✔ 支持</td>\n<td>✔ 支持</td>\n<td>✔ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">安装方法</h3>\n<ol style=\"text-align:left\">\n<li>下载 ZIP 文件</li>\n<li>将其放入你的 Minecraft <code>resourcepacks</code> 文件夹中</li>\n<li>在资源包菜单中启用它</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">兼容性</h3>\n<ul style=\"text-align:left\">\n<li>适用于所有基于原版的玩法</li>\n<li>不兼容更改战锤形状（如 3D 战锤、短战锤等）的材质包</li>\n<li>仅为资源包，无需安装模组</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">标签</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">mace indicator, breach density, breach mace, density mace, mace enchant, pvp mace, breach density indicator, mace pvp, enchantment indicator, vanilla mace, mace breach, mace density, breach indicator, density indicator, pvp indicator, mace enchantments, pvp utility, vanilla pvp, mace visibility, enchant visibility</p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">联系方式</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">如有任何关于 Mace Enchant Indicator 的问题，请联系： <a href=\"mailto:precisionzero.creator@gmail.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">precisionzero.creator@gmail.com</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">许可证</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">保留所有权利</p>",
